<programme start="20261106110000 +0000" stop="20261106115600 +0000" channel="Love Nature 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Islands: Nature&apos;s Wild Laboratories</title><sub-title lang="en">Baffin Island</sub-title><desc lang="en">For half of the year, Baffin Island is locked in ice and nearly unfit for life; when winter releases its grip, its coastline shrinks and millions of visitors thrive while ice-loving locals struggle to survive.</desc><date>20250604</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.2.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E03</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/5d35d7bb8de24622e1116a2675f2e40b.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261106115600 +0000" stop="20261106130100 +0000" channel="Love Nature 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Wild Hunters</title><sub-title lang="en">Weasels and raccoons</sub-title><desc lang="en">Genets, and their relatives the mustelids, like weasels and raccoons, are armed with disproportionate ferocity for such relatively small animals, capable of hunting in almost all terrestrial ecosystems.</desc><credits><director>Juan Antonio Rodríguez Llano</director></credits><date>20240831</date><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/de056ac881e387ede67956ea2e7cb1b3.jpeg"/></programme>
