<programme start="20261105170000 +0000" stop="20261105190000 +0000" channel="NHL Network"><title lang="en">NHL Hockey</title><sub-title lang="en">Chicago Blackhawks at Florida Panthers</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Florida Panthers host the Chicago Blackhawks in an NHL regular-season game at Amerant Bank Arena. At 8-5-2, Florida has won four of the last five meetings between the sides, while Chicago arrives at 4-10-1 having lost four of its last five games.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Hockey</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191278_b_v12_aa.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261105190000 +0000" stop="20261105210000 +0000" channel="NHL Network"><title lang="en">NHL Hockey</title><sub-title lang="en">San Jose Sharks at Los Angeles Kings</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Los Angeles Kings host the San Jose Sharks in an NHL regular-season game at crypto.com Arena. Los Angeles sit 4-7-2 and have alternated wins and losses over their last five, San Jose enters 7-8-1 and took their previous meeting 5-4 on Oct. 3.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Hockey</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191278_b_v12_aa.jpg"/></programme>
