<programme start="20261104220000 +0000" stop="20261104230000 +0000" channel="Smithsonian Channel"><title lang="en">How Did They Fix That?</title><sub-title lang="en">Afterburn</sub-title><desc lang="en">In Southern California, crews rebuild after the 2025 wildfires, cutting firebreaks, repairing emergency water systems, hardening roads and power lines and building fire-resistant homes before the next firestorm.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p25005731_b_v8_ab.jpg"/></programme>
