<programme start="20261106100000 +0000" stop="20261106110000 +0000" channel="TNT US"><title lang="en">FBI</title><sub-title lang="en">No One Left Behind</sub-title><desc lang="en">The team is thrown into a highly political case after four members of the Taliban are shot and one is kidnapped in New York with no record of their entrance into the country; OA struggles to open up to Gemma about his past in Afghanistan.</desc><credits><actor>Missy Peregrym</actor><actor>Zeeko Zaki</actor><actor>Jeremy Sisto</actor></credits><category lang="en">Drama</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p15528073_b_v12_be.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261105020000 +0000" stop="20261105030000 +0000" channel="Todo Drama"><title lang="es">Melissa</title><sub-title lang="es">Sin escrúpulos</sub-title><desc lang="es">Cuneyt va al acantilado creyendo escuchar a Mahinur y cuando está dispuesto a todo, algo se lo impide y regresa a casa de Metin para disfrutar de la fiesta. Cuneyt habla con Metin y le da malas noticias. Orhan busca nuevamente a Busra.</desc><credits><director>Çagil Aydogdu</director><actor>Beren Gökyıldız</actor><actor>Dila Uluca</actor><actor>Ümit Akdemir</actor><actor>Mahmoud Kasalkheh</actor><actor>Sezin Bozaci</actor><actor>Mert Aydogdu</actor><actor>Ali Senol</actor><actor>Onur Dikmen</actor></credits><date>20261104</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.140.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E141</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-14</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/248abc7e9a80151f67ecaae4d8f1ef0f.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261105030000 +0000" stop="20261105040000 +0000" channel="Todo Drama"><title lang="es">Destinos cruzados</title><sub-title lang="es">Destinos cruzados</sub-title><desc lang="es">Toprak despierta de un coma tras cinco años sin recordar nada de su pasado, y regresa a una familia que no reconoce, incluida su prometida de toda la vida y un niño que vive con él. Sin embargo, su amnesia lo mantiene en una incertidumbre constante.</desc><credits><actor>Hazal Adiyaman</actor><actor>Osman Aydin</actor><actor>Asuman Bora</actor><actor>Deniz Aydenk</actor></credits><date>20261104</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.95.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E96</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-G</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/2960546a9bd4c59088b407af9b19cb7e.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261105040000 +0000" stop="20261105050000 +0000" channel="Todo Drama"><title lang="es">El clon</title><sub-title lang="es">Mudanzas</sub-title><desc lang="es">Zen pregunta por la ausencia de la familia de Mohamed en la inauguración. Ali se asegura de que Jade esté bien cuidada. Lucas decide mudarse a un departamento. Dalva se preocupa por que la actitud de Mel empeore con la mudanza de sus padres.</desc><credits><director>Jayme Monjardim</director><actor>Murilo Benício</actor><actor>Giovanna Antonelli</actor><actor>Letícia Sabatella</actor><actor>Juca de Oliveira</actor><actor>Adriana Lessa</actor><actor>Vera Fischer</actor><actor>Reginaldo Faria</actor><actor>Dalton Vigh</actor><actor>Daniela Escobar</actor><actor>Débora Falabella</actor><actor>Eliane Giardini</actor><actor>Antonio Calloni</actor><actor>Stênio Garcia</actor><actor>Jandira Martini</actor><actor>Neuza Borges</actor><actor>Marcello Novaes</actor><actor>Cristiana Oliveira</actor><actor>Nívea Maria</actor><actor>Solange Couto</actor><actor>Osmar Prado</actor><actor>Cissa Guimarães</actor><actor>Marcos Frota</actor><actor>Sthefany Brito</actor></credits><date>20261104</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.141.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E142</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/b65316d2eac9337e39d3d3179595347c.jpeg"/></programme>
